OL,3,AHighest paid world leader to get salary
OL,4,Aincrease of $1 million
OL,5,
OL,6,FSingapore's government says it will
OL,7,Fraise the annual salaries of its
OL,8,Fministers and other office holders,
OL,9,Fincluding its prime minister who is the
OL,10,Fhighest paid political leader in the
OL,11,Fworld.
OL,13,FLawrence Wong will see an increase of
OL,14,F1.4 million Singapore dollars ($1.1m;
OL,15,F#818,000) in his annual pay package. He
OL,16,Fhas said he will donate this pay
OL,17,Fincrease to charity over the next five
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
