OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHighest paid world leader to get salary
OL,4,Aincrease of $1 million
OL,5,
OL,6,FWong said that raising the pay of
OL,7,Fministers was necessary to attract
OL,8,Fbetter talent. The government has
OL,9,Fpreviously argued that paying ministers
OL,10,Fhigh salaries deters corruption.
OL,12,FBut the move has attracted criticism in
OL,13,FSingapore where there is deep concern
OL,14,Fabout job security and the rising cost
OL,15,Fof living.
